 * the MIB URI and the config path are identical for this group.
 *
 * mode is HANDLER_CAN_RWRITE to preserve today's on-the-wire behaviour:
 * lib_moxa_snmp_plugin/src/handler/scalar.c:126 registers every dlmod scalar
 * RWRITE unconditionally. Note that mxMms.mib declares all four read-only, so
 * the MIB and the shipped implementation already disagree; that mismatch is
 * pre-existing and is deliberately NOT changed here, so this migration stays a
 * migration. See the decision log.
 */

